        "steam_appid": 3565010,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/b0e4039cddb1f39d1a38d02e3487287d.avif?t=1786764223\" width=620 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;We want freedom, not slavery,&quot; the goblin muttered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the goblin's declaration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once just an experience fodder at the bottom of another world, now he is determined to challenge the princesses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though it won't be easy, with the blessing of the Nature Goddess, he has been granted the &quot;Power of Rebirth.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So make good use of this power, and in the endless cycles of reincarnation, defeat each princess to find a way to regain freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/3adf75baf0800ce30967ceea254d7c64.poster.avif?t=1786764223\" width=620 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/3adf75baf0800ce30967ceea254d7c64.webm?t=1786764223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/aaa5a077a976ffa0bb39a7f52be51eb9.avif?t=1786764223\" width=620 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple and relaxing idle game. Under your guidance, everything will happen naturally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have prepared numerous CG endings, waiting for you to discover as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/95f2e3d7fbadbb20e7ff04b62bdad8cd.avif?t=1786764223\" width=620 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/fa8ac59e2f4099f1ec5653f2b545a7ff.avif?t=1786764223\" width=620 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/02181baaef76eda2c543fe001d185d00.poster.avif?t=1786764223\" width=620 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/02181baaef76eda2c543fe001d185d00.webm?t=1786764223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How can you defeat the powerful princesses?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain stronger equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn a variety of skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reincarnate in infinite rebirths to gain even greater power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/235034728cfa281629ac721df3e6dd4e.avif?t=1786764223\" width=620 height=190 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/b0e4039cddb1f39d1a38d02e3487287d.avif?t=1786764223\" width=620 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;We want freedom, not slavery,&quot; the goblin muttered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the goblin's declaration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once just an experience fodder at the bottom of another world, now he is determined to challenge the princesses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though it won't be easy, with the blessing of the Nature Goddess, he has been granted the &quot;Power of Rebirth.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So make good use of this power, and in the endless cycles of reincarnation, defeat each princess to find a way to regain freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/3adf75baf0800ce30967ceea254d7c64.poster.avif?t=1786764223\" width=620 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/3adf75baf0800ce30967ceea254d7c64.webm?t=1786764223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/aaa5a077a976ffa0bb39a7f52be51eb9.avif?t=1786764223\" width=620 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple and relaxing idle game. Under your guidance, everything will happen naturally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have prepared numerous CG endings, waiting for you to discover as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/95f2e3d7fbadbb20e7ff04b62bdad8cd.avif?t=1786764223\" width=620 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/fa8ac59e2f4099f1ec5653f2b545a7ff.avif?t=1786764223\" width=620 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/02181baaef76eda2c543fe001d185d00.poster.avif?t=1786764223\" width=620 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/02181baaef76eda2c543fe001d185d00.webm?t=1786764223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How can you defeat the powerful princesses?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain stronger equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn a variety of skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reincarnate in infinite rebirths to gain even greater power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/235034728cfa281629ac721df3e6dd4e.avif?t=1786764223\" width=620 height=190 /></span></p>",
